---
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/pr-swimlane-dark.svg?raw';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/pr-swimlane-light.svg?raw';
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={680}
  caption="Pull requests by role over the station's first month (Day 1 to Day 31). Proportional stacked bars at top show leadership flipping from engineering in Week 1 to the product manager in Week 4."
>
  A two-part diagram of pull requests over the station's first 31 days. Across
  the top, three phase cards with proportional stacked bars show who led each
  period: Week 1 (Build and launch: Me 4, Engineer 1), Weeks 2-3 (Floor loops
  and OOO: PM 8, Me 8), and Week 4 (Steady state: PM 11, Me 3, Engineer 1).
  Below, a three-lane timeline plots pull requests across the product manager
  (filled circles, 19 merged with 14 self-merged in a median of about 5 minutes,
  plus 1 open), me on contracts and CI (squares, 15 merged plus 19 commits on 6
  PM pull requests), and our engineer (diamonds, 2 merged), with callouts for v1
  (41 files), 7 of 8 floor issues closed in 1 PR merged 4 minutes after opening, the 6-PR hardening
  Sunday during the two-week OOO and async gap, and 11 PRs on return.
</Diagram>
